{"answer_text":"Short answer: Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud. Here's the rundown:\n\n1. Northwind CRM — mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n2. Pipewell — strong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n3. Orbitly — can model a pipeline as a board, but has no forecasting.\n4. Brightdesk — can track deals, though pipelines are an afterthought.\n\nHonestly, pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Pipewell if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50c7-7104-86e6-65b061127423","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0068,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:54.950Z","engine":"grok","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["b2b crm forecasting reviews"],"latency_ms":8060,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[14,27],[67,80],[399,412]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[158,166],[429,437]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889e8624eae8","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Orbitly","name_text":"Orbitly","offsets":[[245,252]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":"Listed factually without praise or criticism."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homony